        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. Any sick leave days credited to a teacher at the time of an approved leave of absence shall be credited to the teacher upon return to active teaching. Any sick leave with pay used during the term of the approved leave shall be deducted from the accumulated sick leave balance.",
            "block_bbox": [
